#: pyanaconda/rescue.py:289
msgid "Rescue"
msgstr "Glābšana"

#: pyanaconda/rescue.py:296
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The rescue environment will now attempt to find your Linux installation and "
"mount it under the directory : %s.  You can then make any changes required "
"to your system.  Choose '1' to proceed with this step.\n"
"You can choose to mount your file systems read-only instead of read-write by "
"choosing '2'.\n"
"If for some reason this process does not work choose '3' to skip directly to "
"a shell.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Glābšanas vide tagad mēģinās atrast Jūsu Linux instalāciju un montēt to "
"mapē: %s.  Pēc tam varēsiet veikt nepieciešamās izmaiņas sistēmā.  "
"Izvēlieties „1”, lai turpinātu šo soli.\n"
"Izvēloties „2”, failu sistēmas var montēt tikai lasīšanai, nevis lasīšanai "
"un rakstīšanai.\n"
"Ja kāda iemesla dēļ šis process nedarbojas, izvēlieties „3”, lai pārietu "
"tieši uz čaulu.\n"
"\n"

#: pyanaconda/rescue.py:308
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Turpināt"

#: pyanaconda/rescue.py:309
msgid "Read-only mount"
msgstr "Montēt tikai lasīšanai"

#: pyanaconda/rescue.py:310
msgid "Skip to shell"
msgstr "Pāriet uz čaulu"

#: pyanaconda/rescue.py:311
msgid "Quit (Reboot)"
msgstr "Iziet (pārstartēt)"

#: pyanaconda/rescue.py:408
msgid "Rescue Shell"
msgstr "Glābšanas čaula"

#: pyanaconda/rescue.py:418
#, python-format
msgid "Run %s to unmount the system when you are finished."
msgstr "Kad esat pabeiguši, palaidiet %s, lai atmontētu sistēmu."

#: pyanaconda/rescue.py:419
msgid ""
"When finished, please exit from the shell and your system will reboot.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kad esat pabeiguši, lūdzu, izejiet no čaulas, un sistēma tiks pārstartēta.\n"

#: pyanaconda/rescue.py:430
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your system has been mounted under %(mountpoint)s.\n"
"\n"
"If you would like to make the root of your system the root of the active "
"system, run the command:\n"
"\n"
"\tchroot %(mountpoint)s\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Jūsu sistēma ir montēta zem %(mountpoint)s.\n"
"\n"
"Ja vēlaties padarīt savas sistēmas sakni par aktīvās sistēmas sakni, "
"palaidiet komandu:\n"
"\n"
"\tchroot %(mountpoint)s\n"
"\n"

#: pyanaconda/rescue.py:442
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An error occurred trying to mount some or all of your system: {message}\n"
"\n"
"Some of it may be mounted under {path}."
msgstr ""
"Mēģinot montēt sistēmu vai tās daļu, radās kļūda: {message}\n"
"\n"
"Daļa no tās var būt montēta zem {path}."

